266
00:13:51,170 --> 00:13:52,680
Thanks so much.

267
00:13:52,680 --> 00:13:54,530
OK.

268
00:13:54,530 --> 00:13:59,700
Well, yeah, thanks so
much, Emma, for having us.

269
00:13:59,700 --> 00:14:03,220
It's funny when you talk
