00:33:28,660 --> 00:33:30,170
we ran on this project.

752
00:33:30,170 --> 00:33:32,890
And basically, we took
this IMDb reviewed data

753
00:33:32,890 --> 00:33:35,420
set, which is sort of
like movie reviews,

754
00:33:35,420 --> 00:33:38,680
and we wanted to train the
model to generate positive movie

755
00:33:38,680 --> 00:33:39,200
reviews.

756
00:33:39,200 --> 00:33:42,527
So we use the pre-trained
sentiment classifier

