815
00:36:16,970 --> 00:36:19,337
where is RLHF
really in this case?

816
00:36:19,337 --> 00:36:21,170
Do you think the core
model isn't that good,

817
00:36:21,170 --> 00:36:23,300
or the PPO optimization
isn't that good?

818
00:36:23,300 --> 00:36:26,640
So basically, if you
