964
00:42:27,490 --> 00:42:30,360
But I guess what I
decided to focus on

965
00:42:30,360 --> 00:42:32,670
is this sort of DPO
versus PPO debate, which

966
00:42:32,670 --> 00:42:36,640
is going to be raging a lot on
