improve the robustness, as well.

1504
01:05:56,650 --> 01:05:59,310
And Twitter randomly
stumbled across this

1505
01:05:59,310 --> 01:06:00,990
without really understanding it.

1506
01:06:00,990 --> 01:06:02,560
But it seemed to work for them.

